  "body": "I (on vector.modular.im) was talking to @bwindels (on matrix.org) in a DM (`!IIjQEpRLMKKEPNNcTw:vector.modular.im`) and one of the events (`$TC2N5KGHsJO_e-EeQ75s9e3UvzD_wlouRXDOV-VVbPU`) didn't show up on his client. He says it happened in both Element Web and Hydrogen, so imho the likeliest explanation is that for some reason Synapse didn't send it down sync responses.\r\n\r\nI replied to the message and the reply apparently showed up fine in Bruno's client (instead of telling him the original message can't be displayed) so I'm not ruling out a client/SDK bug but my client dev foo isn't good enough to conclude on where the issue happened, and this issue could probably use a quick investigation to check whether it went missing on the server side of things.",
